{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Diesel Burners",
    "steam_appid": 2616320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616320/extras/cc9df3139bdf23c8e86ae44efe0c5d76.avif?t=1754231220\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><i><strong>The people of Parmesia need you!</strong></i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover the tale of the Legendary Captain Pierre Legrand, as he stands against the threat of the evil emperor Lepetit in the Campaign Mode.<br></li><li>A fully presented story, powered by the charm of the styllized 3D and Diesel Punk art styles.<br></li><li>Not all is about flying. Between missions, take your time to relax in the base, customize your pilot, or prepare your planes for the next mission.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616320/extras/04edfc05a049879e82a5e36f6f162632.avif?t=1754231220\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><i><strong>Much more than a single player arcade shooter!</strong></i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Relive the adrenaline of classic flight arcades with modern controls and updated gameplay.<br></li><li>Dominate the hights with an arsenal of weapons and power-ups.<br></li><li>Collect resources in the field to survive or buy new planes and upgrades.<br></li><li>Pilot and planes customization.<br></li><li>The Commanders will not remain indifferent to your feats. FACE THEM IN EXCITING BOSS BATTLES!<br></li><li>Dozens of unlockables and achievments to put your skills to the test!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616320/extras/45e40711cf832c25c49f489eb29bd202.avif?t=1754231220\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><i><strong>Your Base, more than a simple hub!</strong></i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Reveal the story of the great Pierre Legrand in the Single Player CAMPAIGN MODE.<br></li><li>Unlock environments by completing levels in Single Player ARCADE MODE.  <br></li><li>Enjoy and experiment with everything you have unlocked in the Single Player ENDLESS MODE.<br></li><li>Engage in exciting races against your friends in the local and online Multiplayer PARTY MODE.<br></li><li>Try to best each other up in the local and online Multiplayer BATTLE MODE.<br></li><li>Put those skills to the test together in the local and online Multiplayer BOSS RUSH MODE.<br><br><strong>\u00a1THE MOST COMPLETE AERIAL EXPERIENCE AWAITS YOU!</strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616320/extras/cc9df3139bdf23c8e86ae44efe0c5d76.avif?t=1754231220\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><i><strong>The people of Parmesia need you!</strong></i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover the tale of the Legendary Captain Pierre Legrand, as he stands against the threat of the evil emperor Lepetit in the Campaign Mode.<br></li><li>A fully presented story, powered by the charm of the styllized 3D and Diesel Punk art styles.<br></li><li>Not all is about flying. Between missions, take your time to relax in the base, customize your pilot, or prepare your planes for the next mission.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616320/extras/04edfc05a049879e82a5e36f6f162632.avif?t=1754231220\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><i><strong>Much more than a single player arcade shooter!</strong></i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Relive the adrenaline of classic flight arcades with modern controls and updated gameplay.<br></li><li>Dominate the hights with an arsenal of weapons and power-ups.<br></li><li>Collect resources in the field to survive or buy new planes and upgrades.<br></li><li>Pilot and planes customization.<br></li><li>The Commanders will not remain indifferent to your feats. FACE THEM IN EXCITING BOSS BATTLES!<br></li><li>Dozens of unlockables and achievments to put your skills to the test!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616320/extras/45e40711cf832c25c49f489eb29bd202.avif?t=1754231220\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><i><strong>Your Base, more than a simple hub!</strong></i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Reveal the story of the great Pierre Legrand in the Single Player CAMPAIGN MODE.<br></li><li>Unlock environments by completing levels in Single Player ARCADE MODE.  <br></li><li>Enjoy and experiment with everything you have unlocked in the Single Player ENDLESS MODE.<br></li><li>Engage in exciting races against your friends in the local and online Multiplayer PARTY MODE.<br></li><li>Try to best each other up in the local and online Multiplayer BATTLE MODE.<br></li><li>Put those skills to the test together in the local and online Multiplayer BOSS RUSH MODE.<br><br><strong>\u00a1THE MOST COMPLETE AERIAL EXPERIENCE AWAITS YOU!</strong></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Open-world aerial shooter that blends fast-paced arcade combat, exploration, and deep customization. Fly freely, defend your island from invasion, upgrade your vehicles, unlock gear, and tailor each aircraft to your playstyle. A bold, replayable dieselpunk adventure.",
